    "name": "Crimson Theory",
    "steam_appid": 3572820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Dr. Crimson suggests a different approach. He believes the key lies in prolonging the induced state, pushing the subject deeper into the convergence points. \u201cLet them linger,\u201d he wrote in his latest notes. \u201cLet them witness.\u201d</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.poster.avif?t=1744693292\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.webm?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.mp4?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if the monsters you feared... were born from your own memories?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crimson Theory</i> is a psychological horror game that blends mystery, survival, and dream logic in a surreal descent through guilt, trauma, and forgotten truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in your grandmother\u2019s empty home, with no memory of how you arrived. Handwritten notes\u2014left by <i>you</i>\u2014suggest a deeper mystery. As the lines between dream and reality blur, you enter a shadow version of a hospital filled with monsters shaped by your past traumas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Theory reminds you that fear isn\u2019t just something lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s the uncertainty that takes root in the mind. The line between dreams and reality is gone. Your mind is on the battlefield, and something is trying to break in. This isn\u2019t just survival. <strong>It\u2019s a reckoning.</strong> When the final door opens, you won\u2019t escape. <strong>You\u2019ll remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.poster.avif?t=1744693292\" width=736 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.webm?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.mp4?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Explore Two Parallel Realities</strong> \u2013 Shift between the real world and a distorted dimension to uncover clues and escape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Sleep to Survive</strong> \u2013 Use a unique sleep mechanic to access hidden symbols, unveil memories, and face the Night Watchers\u2014enigmatic enemies that only appear in your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solve Symbolic Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Each creature has meaning. Each symbol tells a story. Only by understanding the nightmare can you escape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> \u2013 Discover that you are not just lost... Trapped between life and death, your soul is part of an experiment. Only by confronting yourself can you be set free.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Dr. Crimson suggests a different approach. He believes the key lies in prolonging the induced state, pushing the subject deeper into the convergence points. \u201cLet them linger,\u201d he wrote in his latest notes. \u201cLet them witness.\u201d</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.poster.avif?t=1744693292\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.webm?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/31c73d90b0ce9a9f12dc2055deb2e988.mp4?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if the monsters you feared... were born from your own memories?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crimson Theory</i> is a psychological horror game that blends mystery, survival, and dream logic in a surreal descent through guilt, trauma, and forgotten truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in your grandmother\u2019s empty home, with no memory of how you arrived. Handwritten notes\u2014left by <i>you</i>\u2014suggest a deeper mystery. As the lines between dream and reality blur, you enter a shadow version of a hospital filled with monsters shaped by your past traumas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Theory reminds you that fear isn\u2019t just something lurking in the shadows\u2014it\u2019s the uncertainty that takes root in the mind. The line between dreams and reality is gone. Your mind is on the battlefield, and something is trying to break in. This isn\u2019t just survival. <strong>It\u2019s a reckoning.</strong> When the final door opens, you won\u2019t escape. <strong>You\u2019ll remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.poster.avif?t=1744693292\" width=736 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.webm?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572820/extras/c8f0a36b5989fe60d2adc23e54905849.mp4?t=1744693292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Explore Two Parallel Realities</strong> \u2013 Shift between the real world and a distorted dimension to uncover clues and escape your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Sleep to Survive</strong> \u2013 Use a unique sleep mechanic to access hidden symbols, unveil memories, and face the Night Watchers\u2014enigmatic enemies that only appear in your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solve Symbolic Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Each creature has meaning. Each symbol tells a story. Only by understanding the nightmare can you escape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> \u2013 Discover that you are not just lost... Trapped between life and death, your soul is part of an experiment. Only by confronting yourself can you be set free.</p>",
